 listing.seller_id    | integer in json                  | f        | Schema.Number                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            | 
 listing.title        | text in json                     | f        | Schema.String                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            | 
 listing.price_kobo   | bigint in json                   | f        | Schema.Number                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            | JSON number can lose precision, cast to ::text
 listing.status       | listing_status in json           | f        | Schema.Literals(["draft", "active", "sold"])                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | 
 listing.tags         | json array                       | f        | Schema.Array(Schema.NullOr(Schema.String))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | 
 listing.tags[]       | text in json                     | t        | Schema.NullOr(Schema.String)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | nullability unknown, assumed nullable
